      "en": "David and all the house of Israel played before the LORD with all kinds of instruments made of cypress wood, with harps, with stringed instruments, with tambourines, with castanets, and with cymbals.",
      "ko": "다윗과 이스라엘 온 족속이 잣나무로 만든 여러가지 악기와 수금과 비파와 소고와 양금과 제금으로 여호와 앞에서 주악하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "9279c80c4e5992666eb3fa8fa8e16ae206c572b05b1dd9c8964b8beab750be4a",
      "translation_text_hash": "78483b7f4701ce37be97bf9081722029f5d397041c5c2a6e7df2075eef4f9fdd",
