        {
          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 6,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "David was displeased because the LORD had broken out against Uzzah; and he called that place Perez Uzzah to this day.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 웃사를 충돌하시므로 다윗이 분하여 그곳을 베레스웃사라 칭하니 그 이름이 오늘까지 이르니라",
      "source_text_hash": "4daa32be6ada6b13b6dd1d9c3dd88f0e777407d2d4b30a043ecf89c18a4704b2",
      "translation_text_hash": "530e2d397b7988157e8c1c3d6e8b625c3cebbdf57eaf653879ef7406e79bc13f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
