        }
      ],
      "en": "They brought in the LORD’s ark, and set it in its place in the middle of the tent that David had pitched for it; and David offered burnt offerings and peace offerings before the LORD.",
      "ko": "여호와의 궤를 메고 들어가서 다윗이 위하여 친 장막 가운데 그 예비한 자리에 두매 다윗이 번제와 화목제를 여호와 앞에 드리니라",
      "source_text_hash": "6f97da9b41140dc60bce81872c5ff27dff4f95d4aa95f898226ea893416f3212",
      "translation_text_hash": "30778a63d33b45a8d415e7dbf1f84cd3c0f3d88c3e1d5a7db76f7117920349ab",
