      "en": "I will be yet more undignified than this, and will be worthless in my own sight. But the maids of whom you have spoken will honor me.”",
      "ko": "내가 이보다 더 낮아져서 스스로 천하게 보일찌라도 네가 말한바 계집종에게는 내가 높임을 받으리라 한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "73e9dbbb302136eb70c3bccc92299ae40816e59c2688f68880b656a35db2ccd5",
      "translation_text_hash": "e3c06792e7d6600904528e1c3752c3871286e7e6c53c66fd1276d51639a97e3d",
